WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.440
How terrible for you who are rich now!

00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:04.550
You have had your easy life.

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:07.370
How terrible for you who laugh now,

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:09.450
for you shall mourn and weep.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:13.200
How terrible when all men speak well of you,

00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:18.180
for their ancestors said the very same things about the false prophets.

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:21.760
But I tell you who hear Me:

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:23.920
Love your enemies.

00:00:25.270 --> 00:00:28.060
Do good to those who hate you.

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:31.490
Bless those who curse you.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:34.750
And pray for those who mistreat you.

00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:38.660
If anyone strikes you on the one cheek,

00:00:39.030 --> 00:00:41.680
let him hit the other one also.

00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:48.130
And if someone takes away your coat, let him have your shirt as well.

00:00:48.490 --> 00:00:51.490
Give to everyone who asks you for something.

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:54.200
And if someone takes what is yours,

00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:56.720
do not ask for it back again.

00:00:57.470 --> 00:00:59.010
Do for others

00:00:59.270 --> 00:01:01.690
only what you would have others do for you.

00:01:02.470 --> 00:01:05.880
If you love only the people who love you,

00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:09.190
why should you receive a blessing?

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:11.710
For even sinners love those who love them.

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:15.000
And if you do good to those who do good to you,

00:01:15.220 --> 00:01:17.740
why should you receive a blessing?

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:20.860
Even sinners do that.

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.200
love your enemies,

00:01:23.270 --> 00:01:24.600
and do good to them.

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:27.310
And lend expecting nothing back.

00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:29.810
And then you will have a great reward,

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:33.500
for you will be sons of the Most High God.

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:37.010
For He is good to the ungrateful and to the wicked.

00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:38.700
Be merciful,

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:41.510
just as your Father is merciful.

00:01:42.290 --> 00:01:45.800
Judge not and you will not be judged!

00:01:45.970 --> 00:01:47.490
Condemn not,

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:50.610
and you will not be condemned!

00:01:50.730 --> 00:01:52.640
Forgive,

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:54.390
and you will be forgiven.

00:01:54.950 --> 00:01:58.440
Give, and it will be given to you.

00:01:58.610 --> 00:02:01.950
For the measure you give will be the measure you get back.

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:07.080
One blind man cannot lead another!

00:02:07.240 --> 00:02:10.740
If he does they will both fall into a ditch.

00:02:10.890 --> 00:02:15.900
Why do you see the speck that is in your brother's eye but pay no attention to the log in your own eye?
